    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "October, 2024: Welcome new maintainers: [jxu](https://github.com/jxu), [mhayter](https://github.com/mhayter) and [kostero](https://github.com/kostero)!",
      "source_hash": 7124820944475706165,
      "context_hash": 12472789423513800845,
      "translation": "2024년 10월: 새 관리자 [jxu](https://github.com/jxu), [mhayter](https://github.com/mhayter), [kostero](https://github.com/kostero)를 환영합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099706Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "October, 15, 2024: GitHub pages based mirror is now served at [https://gh.cp-algorithms.com/](https://gh.cp-algorithms.com/), and an auxiliary competitive programming library is available at [https://lib.cp-algorithms.com/](https://lib.cp-algorithms.com/).",
      "source_hash": 4137630032320539670,
      "context_hash": 16454857302979768808,
      "translation": "2024년 10월 15일: 이제 GitHub Pages 기반 미러가 [https://gh.cp-algorithms.com/](https://gh.cp-algorithms.com/)에서 제공되며, 보조 경쟁 프로그래밍 라이브러리를 [https://lib.cp-algorithms.com/](https://lib.cp-algorithms.com/)에서 이용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099706Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "July 16, 2024: Major overhaul of the [Finding strongly connected components / Building condensation graph](https://cp-algorithms.com/graph/strongly-connected-components.html) article.",
      "source_hash": 3399079068932976290,
      "context_hash": 1948540169576141180,
      "translation": "2024년 7월 16일: [강한 연결 요소 찾기 / 축약 그래프 만들기](https://cp-algorithms.com/graph/strongly-connected-components.html) 글을 대폭 개편했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099706Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "June 26, 2023: Added automatic RSS feeds for [new articles](https://cp-algorithms.com/feed_rss_created.xml) and [updates in articles](https://cp-algorithms.com/feed_rss_updated.xml).",
      "source_hash": 14800435267441616067,
      "context_hash": 6852010985088666099,
      "translation": "2023년 6월 26일: [새 글](https://cp-algorithms.com/feed_rss_created.xml)과 [글 업데이트](https://cp-algorithms.com/feed_rss_updated.xml)에 대한 자동 RSS 피드를 추가했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099706Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "December 20, 2022: The repository name and the owning organizations were renamed!",
      "source_hash": 4413733092946469783,
      "context_hash": 15888056372288898769,
      "translation": "2022년 12월 20일: 저장소 이름과 소유 조직의 이름이 변경되었습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Now the repo is located at [https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms](https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms).",
      "source_hash": 505092584318647292,
      "context_hash": 8991778769763700809,
      "translation": "이제 저장소는 [https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms](https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms)에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:2",
      "source": "It is recommended to update the upstream link in your local repositories, if you have any.",
      "source_hash": 5877251003387755722,
      "context_hash": 8417736450014452669,
      "translation": "로컬 저장소가 있다면 upstream 링크를 업데이트하시기를 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "October 31, 2022: It is now possible to select and copy $\\LaTeX$ source code of formulas within the articles.",
      "source_hash": 5192763897203517478,
      "context_hash": 12695031867509164065,
      "translation": "2022년 10월 31일: 이제 글 안에 있는 수식의 $\\LaTeX$ 소스 코드를 선택하여 복사할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "June 8, 2022: Tags are enabled.",
      "source_hash": 5047759480726496278,
      "context_hash": 16609173970186053843,
      "translation": "2022년 6월 8일: 태그 기능이 활성화되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "Each article is now marked whether it is translated or original, overall tag info is present in the [tag index](https://cp-algorithms.com/tags.html).",
      "source_hash": 11909762831267719583,
      "context_hash": 4462747457272516892,
      "translation": "이제 각 글에는 번역된 글인지 원본 글인지가 표시되며, 전체 태그 정보는 [태그 색인](https://cp-algorithms.com/tags.html)에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "For translated articles, clicking on `From: X` tag would lead to the original article.",
      "source_hash": 5704645628493834308,
      "context_hash": 16731364918188169602,
      "translation": "번역된 글의 경우 `From: X` 태그를 클릭하면 원본 글로 이동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "June 7, 2022: Date of last commit and author list with contribution percentage is tracked for each page.",
      "source_hash": 14354906132483888424,
      "context_hash": 14293351270857512142,
      "translation": "2022년 6월 7일: 각 페이지마다 마지막 커밋 날짜와 기여 비율이 포함된 작성자 목록이 기록됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "June 5, 2022: Enabled content tabs and sidebar navigation.",
      "source_hash": 3052356096807763116,
      "context_hash": 455833357919840018,
      "translation": "2022년 6월 5일: 콘텐츠 탭과 사이드바 내비게이션이 활성화되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "The navigation is moved to a [separate page](https://cp-algorithms.com/navigation.html) and its structure should be adjusted in [navigation.md](https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms/blob/main/src/navigation.md) whenever a new article is created or an old one is moved.",
      "source_hash": 13538802982175760143,
      "context_hash": 14396898137558758288,
      "translation": "내비게이션은 [별도 페이지](https://cp-algorithms.com/navigation.html)로 옮겨졌으며, 새 글을 만들거나 기존 글을 옮길 때마다 [navigation.md](https://github.com/cp-algorithms/cp-algorithms/blob/main/src/navigation.md)에서 그 구조를 수정해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.099707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "January 16, 2022: Switched to the [MkDocs](https://www.mkdocs.org/) site generator with the [Material for MkDocs](https://squidfunk.github.io/mkdocs-material/) theme, which give the website a more modern look, brings a couple of new features (dark mode, better search, ...), makes the website more stable (in terms of rendering math formulas), and makes it easier to contribute.",
      "source_hash": 6210191715618631372,
      "context_hash": 15491659271619228860,
      "translation": "2022년 1월 16일: [Material for MkDocs](https://squidfunk.github.io/mkdocs-material/) 테마를 사용하는 [MkDocs](https://www.mkdocs.org/) 사이트 생성기로 전환했습니다. 이를 통해 웹사이트가 더 현대적인 모습을 갖추었고, 몇 가지 새로운 기능(다크 모드, 개선된 검색 등)이 추가되었으며, (수식 렌더링 측면에서) 웹사이트가 더 안정적으로 바뀌었고, 기여하기도 더 쉬워졌습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:51:25.100786Z",
      "issues": []
    },
